---
import AlignmentCompoundingChart from "./AlignmentCompoundingChart.astro";
---

<section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.95fr)_minmax(0,1.25fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-14">
      <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-5">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">Why Consistency Still Breaks</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">More franchise systems break from misalignment than from bad process.</h2>
        <p class="section-copy max-w-3xl">
          Franchisors often improve marketing, sales, training, and field support but still get uneven outcomes.
          The root issue is disconnected decisions across the lifecycle -- who is attracted, who is awarded, how learning
          lands, and how execution holds up under pressure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Signal graphic -->
      <div class="lg:justify-self-end lg:w-full">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#6c7280]">How decisions compound</p>
        <div class="mt-5">
          <AlignmentCompoundingChart />
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
